</math> yields <math alttext="StartRoot 2 x EndRoot equals 4"><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>. Squaring both sides of this equation yields <math alttext="2 x equals 16"><mrow>
	<mrow>
