\n<li>(negative 1 comma negative 8)&nbsp;</li>\n<li>(0 comma negative 6)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul></div></figure></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The graph of <math alttext=\"y equals 2 x squared plus b x plus c\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t\t</msup>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mi>b</mi>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mi>c</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math> is shown, where <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"c\"><mi>c</mi>\n</math> are constants. What is the value of <math alttext=\"b c\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>b</mi>\n\t<mi>c</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math>?</p>","type":"spr","correct_answer":["-24"]},"createDate":1730147357399,"updateDate":1730147357399}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1730147357399, 1730147357399),
    ($SATQ$09e5e4d3$SATQ$, $SATQ$3ba3f345-5069-44e0-84d8-8513595b8722$SATQ$::uuid, NULL, NULL, $SATQ$qbank$SATQ$, $SATQ$SAT$SATQ$, 2, $SATQ$Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$Advanced Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$P$SATQ$, $SATQ$P.B.$SATQ$, $SATQ$Nonlinear equations in one variable and systems of equations in two variables $SATQ$, $SATQ$M$SATQ$, 4, $SATQ$mcq$SATQ$, NULL, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">If <math alttext="StartFraction 42 Over x EndFraction equals 7 x"><mrow>
